        "params": {
          "text": "THERMOSTAT_NARROW_BAND\nHeater lag 10 s; setpoint 20 degC; hysteresis +/-0.1 K; ambient 15 -> 10 at 600 s.\nRun 1200 s at 10 Hz; open the scopes.\nEquations, experiments and limits: examples/relay/README.md.\nExperimental: manual Studio workflow has not been qualified.",
